<title>USA: Aliant says starts trading under new name.</title>
<headline>Aliant says starts trading under new name.</headline>
<dateline>LINCOLN, Neb. 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aliant Communications Inc said it began trading today on the NASDAQ Stock Market under the symbol ALNT.</p>
<p>The communications company was formerly called Lincoln Telecommunications Co and its former stock symbol was LTEC, it said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
